      "id": "23",
      "slug": "elearning-africa-dakar-senegal-2023",
      "title": "E-Learning Africa Dakar 2023 — VR booth experience",
      "description": "Trade-fair project for the German Academy of Digital Education at E-Learning Africa 2023 in Dakar: an interactive VR experience in the German Pavilion that let visitors step into a Solar / Inverter training scenario. Pre-visualised the booth in Archicad, modelled scene assets in Blender, built and rendered the VR experience in Unreal Engine, then ran the stand on-site—onboarding visitors, presenting DADB courses and XR demos, and handling hardware in real time.",
      "date": "2023-05-25",
      "tags": [
        "video",
        "VR",
        "education",
        "trade fair",
        "3D",
        "visualization",
        "project management"
      ],
      "type": "video",
      "thumbnail": "/projects/elearning-africa-dakar-senegal-2023/vr-scene-07-thumb.jpg",
      "images": [
        "/projects/elearning-africa-dakar-senegal-2023/vr-scene-07-thumb.jpg"
      ],
      "videoUrl": "/projects/elearning-africa-dakar-senegal-2023/linkedin-vr-trailer.webm",
      "tools": [
        {
          "name": "Archicad",
          "icon": "/tool-icons/archicad.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "Blender",
          "icon": "/tool-icons/blender.png"
        },
        {
