      "id": "22",
      "slug": "elearning-africa-kigali-2024",
      "title": "E-Learning Africa Kigali 2024 — AR inverter installation",
      "description": "Trade-fair project for the German Academy of Digital Education at E-Learning Africa 2024 in Kigali: an interactive augmented-reality experience that teaches inverter installation together with SMA experts and course teams. Led coordination across editorial, production, internal SMEs, and partners; pre-visualized the booth in Archicad and rendered planning shots in Unreal Engine—with Blender in the 3D pipeline—so layout, visitor routing, presentation zones, and the AR area were validated before Rwanda.",
      "date": "2024-09-30",
      "tags": [
        "video",
        "AR",
        "education",
        "trade fair",
